          "description": "Make tidying up fun with imaginative audio games that turn chores into play! Kids will freeze, spy, hop, dance, and dash their way through clean-up time with silly challenges, themed activities, and upbeat prompts that spark laughter and motivation. With games like “The Floor Is Lava,” “Scavenger Hunt Cleanup,” and “Rylee Says,” cleaning becomes an exciting adventure. Just pick a game, press play, and let the fun(aka cleaning) begin!",
